OL,4,Asolving 400-year-old mystery
OL,5,
OL,6,FMuseum experts have used CT scanning to
OL,7,Fexamine the lock's internal mechanism,
OL,8,Fidentify the correct letter combination
OL,9,Fand solve the mystery.
